  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Valero Marketing and Supply has $520M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Valero Marketing and Supply received 109 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $4.8M. Obligations fell 55.9% year over year. Year-by-year obligations show a peak and then a decline: FY21 was $513M, FY22 was $1.4B, FY23 was $1.2B, FY24 was $1.1B, FY25 was $1.2B, and FY26 is $520M. The current-year total is partial because fiscal-year-to-date totals are included. The award-count and average-award-size figures describe the current-year pace of work and contract sizing. The year-over-year change quantifies the decline in obligations from the prior fiscal period to FY2026 to date. Stakeholders looking at pipeline or capacity should treat FY26 as an in-progress total, not a full-year result.",
